## DB

```elixir
opts = [
  hostname: "localhost",
  port: 5432,
  username: "postgres",
  password: "postgres",
  database: "slink_dev"
]

{:ok, conn} = Kino.start_child({Postgrex, opts})
Kino.nothing()
```

